---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro"
---

<Layout
  title="The Witness — Scudra"
  description="The same URL, seen from three countries at once. A geo-diff experience built with stealth cloud browsers and residential proxies."
>
  <article class="sc-container py-20 max-w-[72ch]" data-reveal>
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink-muted mb-4">
      <a href="/experiences" class="no-underline text-inherit hover:text-ink">← Experiences</a>
    </p>

    <h1 class="font-serif text-[clamp(2.25rem,5vw,3.5rem)] leading-[1.1] tracking-tight mb-4">
      The Witness
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-8">
      The same URL, seen from three countries at once. The Witness visits a page from the United States, Germany, and Singapore — each through a stealth browser with a residential proxy — extracts the comparable surface of what each location saw, and diffs the results live.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-12">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/sneldao/scudra/tree/main/apps/witness"
        class="sc-button-primary"
      >
        Run it locally
      </a>
      <a
        href="/recipes/stealth-scraper"
        class="sc-button-secondary"
      >
        Read the recipe
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="p-6 bg-paper-warm rounded-sc border border-black/5">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl mb-4">What it demonstrates</h2>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-ink-muted leading-relaxed list-disc pl-5">
        <li><strong>Stealth + residential proxy.</strong> Each location runs <code>stealth: true</code> with a country proxy, and the egress IP is confirmed on every run as the alibi.</li>
        <li><strong>Concurrent egress.</strong> The three locations run in parallel — a geo-diff must sample the world at roughly the same moment.</li>
        <li><strong>The teardown moment.</strong> Every browser session is closed and released after its single observation. Nothing persists.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
